## Repository structure

```text
├── .streamlit/                              # Streamlit config
├── data/                                    # Raw Olist CSV datasets
│   ├── olist_customers_dataset.csv
│   ├── olist_order_items_dataset.csv
│   ├── olist_order_reviews_dataset.csv
│   └── olist_orders_dataset.csv
├── Customer satisfaction report.pdf         # Detailed written report
├── Customer-Satisfaction-Presentation.pptx  # Stakeholder slide deck
├── Data_cleaning.ipynb                      # Data preparation notebook
├── olist_app.py                             # Main Streamlit application
├── olist_dashboard.db                       # SQLite database
├── pora_logo.png                            # Branding asset
├── requirements.txt                         # Python dependencies
└── README.md                                # This file
